  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government of Australia &amp; the Pacific Islands Forum Secretariat Partnership 2014-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports the Pacific Islands Forum Secretariat (PIFS)- Australia Partnership Arrangement up to 2024. The Partnership sets out how Australia and PIFS will work together to address major regional development issues in line with PIFS&#x2019; mandate and will provide the mechanism through which all Australian ODA funds are provided to PIFS. It also guides the way in which all Australian Government stakeholders work with PIFS.</narrative>
  </description>
